' ============================= relationships ==============================
' ---- firmware ----
Sketch *-- "2" MPU6500
Sketch *-- "2" MadgwickAHRS
Sketch *-- FwEmg
Sketch --> BLEStreamer : bleStreamer
BLEStreamer ..> SensorPacket : sends
BLEStreamer ..> ArmBandBleService : BLE notify and write

' ---- mobile: link and controller ----
ArmBandBleService ..> ArmBandProtocol
ArmBandBleService ..> ArmBandSample : decodes
ArmBandBleService ..> ArmBandScanResult
ArmBandBleService ..> ArmBandCommand : writes
ArmBandBleService ..> ArmBandException : throws
ArmBandException <|-- ArmBandPermissionDenied
ArmBandException <|-- ArmBandBluetoothOff
ArmBandException <|-- ArmBandUnsupportedPlatform
ArmBandException <|-- ArmBandStepTimeout
ArmBandException <|-- ArmBandNotFound
ArmBandException <|-- ArmBandProtocolMismatch
ArmBandException <|-- ArmBandSuperseded
WearableConnectionController *-- ArmBandBleService
WearableConnectionController *-- ReconnectBackoff
WearableConnectionController --> OnboardingRepository : saveWearable, reportWearablePresence
WearableConnectionController --> WearableConnState
HomeShell *-- WearableConnectionController : owns
BandRequiredGate --> WearableConnectionController
HomeScreen --> WearableConnectionController
HomeScreen --> HomeRepository
HomeRepository ..> HomeSnapshot
HomeSnapshot o-- TodaysPlan
HomeSnapshot o-- LastSessionSnapshot
HomeSnapshot o-- HomeBaseline
TodaysPlan o-- "*" ExerciseAssignment

' ---- mobile: routing ----
AuthGate --> AuthService
AuthGate --> OnboardingRepository : hasBaseline, hydrate
AuthGate ..> PatientProfile
AuthGate ..> HomeShell : approved + calibrated
AuthGate ..> OnboardingFlow : not calibrated
AuthGate ..> WaitingForPhysioScreen : awaiting approval
HomeShell *-- HomeScreen
HomeShell *-- PlanListScreen
HomeShell --> SessionJournal : recover / sync
HomeShell ..> PatientProfile

' ---- mobile: onboarding and calibration ----
OnboardingFlow *-- OnboardingData
OnboardingFlow --> OnboardingRepository
OnboardingFlow *-- CalibrationStep
OnboardingFlow *-- WearableSetupStep
OnboardingData *-- ArmBandBleService : band
OnboardingData o-- Clinic
OnboardingData o-- Physiotherapist
OnboardingData o-- WearableDevice
OnboardingData o-- OnbBaseline
CalibrationStep --> OnboardingData
CalibrationStep *-- BaselineRecorder
CalibrationStep ..> ArmBandCommand : g, z, m
BaselineRecorder ..> OnbBaseline : result()
OnboardingRepository ..> OnboardingException
OnboardingRepository ..> SignUpResult

' ---- mobile: exercises and session ----
PlanListScreen --> ExercisesRepository
PlanListScreen ..> ExerciseDetailScreen
ExerciseDetailScreen ..> ActiveSessionScreen
ExerciseDetailScreen *-- ExerciseMedia
ExercisesRepository --> OnboardingRepository : care-team names
ExercisesRepository ..> PlanSummary
PlanSummary o-- "*" AssignedExercise
ActiveSessionScreen --> SessionController
ActiveSessionScreen --> WearableConnectionController
ActiveSessionScreen --> ExercisesRepository : saveSession
ActiveSessionScreen --> SessionJournal
ActiveSessionScreen *-- LiveTwinView
SessionController <|.. LiveSession
SessionController <|.. SessionSimulator
LiveSession o-- RepAssessor
LiveSession o-- FatigueEstimator
LiveSession o-- ElbowRepChecker : amber, after each rep
LiveSession o-- SafetyMonitor : red, every sample
ElbowRepChecker *-- ElbowAutoencoder
ElbowRepChecker ..> RepCheck
SafetyMonitor o-- SafetyLimits
LiveSession ..> ArmBandSample : consumes stream
LiveSession ..> RepMetrics
RepAssessor ..> RepMetrics
RepAssessor ..> RepAssessment
RepAssessment o-- SessionAlert
SessionSimulator o-- SensorFusion
SessionSimulator o-- EmgProcessor
SessionSimulator o-- AiEngine
AiEngine ..> RepAssessment
SessionController ..> SessionResult : buildResult()
SessionResult o-- AssignedExercise
SessionResult o-- "*" SessionAlert
SessionResult ..> MuscleActivation
SessionResult ..> FatigueLevel
SessionResult ..> SafetyTier
SessionAlert ..> SafetyTier
SessionJournal ..> SessionResult
SessionJournal ..> UnfinishedSession
SessionJournal ..> ExercisesRepository : syncPending()

' ---- mobile: twin ----
TwinController <|.. TwinBridge
LiveTwinView *-- TwinBridge
LiveTwinView --> TwinAssetServer
LiveTwinView ..> ArmBandSample

' ---- mobile: profile and progress ----
ProfileRepository ..> ProfileData
ProfileData o-- PairedDevice
ProgressRepository ..> ProgressData

' ---- mobile to backend ----
AuthService ..> SbAuth
OnboardingRepository ..> DB
OnboardingRepository ..> Rpc
ExercisesRepository ..> DB
HomeRepository ..> DB
ProfileRepository ..> DB
ProgressRepository ..> DB

' ---- web portal ----
App --> PatientUseCases
App --> WearablePresenceUseCases
App *-- PortalShell
App *-- PhysioShell
App *-- AdminPanels : admin tabs
App *-- DashboardPage : physio pages
App *-- PatientsPage
App *-- ApprovalsPage
App *-- AtRiskPage
App *-- ExercisesPage
DashboardPage --> PatientUseCases
ApprovalsPage --> PatientUseCases
AtRiskPage --> PatientUseCases
AtRiskPage --> SessionUseCases
PatientsPage --> ExercisePlanUseCases
PatientsPage --> ExerciseUseCases
PatientsPage --> SessionUseCases
ExercisesPage --> ExerciseUseCases
AdminPanels --> Hooks : panel data
App --> Hooks : useAuth, usePhysiotherapists
PatientUseCases ..> Patient : builds
PatientUseCases --> SessionUseCases
PatientUseCases ..> Analytics
ExercisePlanUseCases ..> Analytics
ExerciseUseCases --> ExerciseRepository
ExerciseRepository ..> Exercise : builds
DashboardPage ..> VisualizationService
PatientsPage ..> VisualizationService
ApprovalsPage ..> VisualizationService
AtRiskPage ..> VisualizationService
ExercisesPage ..> VisualizationService
PatientUseCases ..> WebSupabase
SessionUseCases ..> WebSupabase
ExercisePlanUseCases ..> WebSupabase
WearablePresenceUseCases ..> WebSupabase
ExerciseRepository ..> WebSupabase
Hooks ..> WebSupabase
Hooks ..> Edge : sign-in, manage physios
WebSupabase ..> DB
WebSupabase ..> SbAuth
WearablePresenceUseCases ..> SbRealtime : channel on wearable_devices
WearablePresenceUseCases ..> Rpc : get_wearable_presence

note bottom of AiEngine
  AiEngine is a random stand-in used only by SessionSimulator.
  Live sessions use the trained model (ElbowRepChecker, amber) and
  the live SafetyMonitor (red). RepAssessor's simple rules are the
  fallback when the model file cannot be loaded.
end note

note right of OnboardingRepository
  The calibration baseline is stored as a session with no
  exercise plus a movement_analysis row marked
  posture_status = 'baseline_calibration'.
end note
@enduml
